 "rule": "Every soul hit you land adds a Toll, and Tolls fade slowly (1 every 4 pulses). Each time you ring the bell it strikes the foe's soul once more for every Toll you hold, with no limit. With 3 Tolls, 1 Slackened Soul on the foe, or another art of the canon fired the same pulse, the next ring is a Great Peal that spends 3 Tolls for a heavy extra soul strike; the ring after that, with 5 Tolls and either 2 Slackened Soul on the foe or you at 40 % health or less, is a Death Knell that spends 6 Tolls for a far heavier one and slackens the foe's soul.",
 "hooks": ["soul hits landed", "toll gained from other sources", "art speed", "trigger damage", "x_soul", "soul resistance down", "low health", "crit"], "sources": ["bell-of-waking", "lamp-threading-needle"]},

